<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" version="24.0.0"><diagram id="flow" name="1. 전체 실행 흐름"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="1.1" value="ArtI PC2 코스 주행 전체 흐름 (실물 TurtleBot4 #4)  —  함수 / 상태 / 토픽" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.2" value="a_course_node.py  (ROS 노드: 센서 수신 · 명령 실행)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#bbbbbb;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="80" width="470" height="3510" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.3" value="course_engine.py  TourMachine  (판단: 상태 전이 → Event 반환)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#bbbbbb;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="80" width="920" height="3510" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.4" value="외부  (사용자 / Nav2 / Create3 / hardcoded_tts_node.py)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#bbbbbb;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1430" y="80" width="470" height="3510" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.5" value='사전 실행 (사람이 직접)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:11px"&gt;① loc 4 ~/arti/maps/gallery.yaml  (map_server + AMCL)&lt;br&gt;② rv 4  (RViz, 필요시 2D Pose Estimate)&lt;br&gt;③ arti-nav  (Nav2, nav2_real.yaml: xy_goal_tolerance 0.12)&lt;br&gt;④ ros2 launch arti_pc2_nav a_course.launch.py ...&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1ba1e2;strokeColor=#006EAF;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="120" width="420" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.6" value="&lt;b&gt;a_course.launch.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;generate_launch_description()&lt;br&gt;• a_course_node  (namespace robot4, /tf→tf 리맵)&lt;br&gt;• hardcoded_tts_node  (start_tts:=true, engine gtts)&lt;br&gt;• zone_marker_node  (RViz 반원: arti/a_course/zones)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="120" width="420" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e7" value="④ 실행" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.5" target="1.6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.8" value="&lt;b&gt;ACourseNode.__init__()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• declare_parameter(enable_motion, simulation_mode, explanation_transport=topic, post_undock_settle_time 3.0 …)&lt;br&gt;• load_course_config(a_course.yaml) → CoursePlan&lt;br&gt;• TourMachine(plan)  /  _lifecycle GetState 클라이언트 5개&lt;br&gt;• 구독: amcl_pose(reliable+transient_local), odom, scan, battery_state, dock_status, arti/tour/select …&lt;br&gt;• create_timer(0.1, _tick)  → 10Hz 메인 루프" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="270" width="420" height="136" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.9" value="&lt;b&gt;guided_tour_plan.load_course_config()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• kiosk / artworks 1~4: Pose2D.parse(), Semicircle.parse()&lt;br&gt;• zone.contains(goal) 검사 (반원 밖이면 예외 → 이동 차단)&lt;br&gt;• exit.goal_pose (-0.04, 2.04), farewell 안녕히가세요&lt;br&gt;• dock.approach_pose (-0.35, -0.0957)&lt;br&gt;→ TourMachine.state = &lt;b&gt;IDLE&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="270" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e10" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.6" target="1.8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e11" value="설정 로드" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.8" target="1.9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.12" value="&lt;b&gt;사용자 출발 명령&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ros2 topic pub -w 1 -r 1 -t 3 \&lt;br&gt;/robot4/arti/tour/select std_msgs/String '{data: A}'&lt;br&gt;(--once는 discovery server에서 유실 → 반복 발행)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="420" width="420" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.13" value="&lt;b&gt;_on_request(msg)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 진행 중이면 _reject('코스주행 중복 요청')&lt;br&gt;• parse_course_request('A') → CourseRequest(uuid, all=True)&lt;br&gt;• _check_ready()  호출&lt;br&gt;• dock_status 최신(3초 이내) 확인" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="420" width="420" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e14" value="arti/tour/select" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.12" target="1.13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.15" value="&lt;b&gt;_check_ready()&lt;/b&gt;  (실패 이유 문자열 / None)&lt;br&gt;• enable_motion, AMCL pose 존재, odom 3초 이내&lt;br&gt;• [실물] 도킹 중이면 pose신선도·scan·TF 검사 생략 (LiDAR 꺼짐)&lt;br&gt;• Nav2 server_is_ready, lifecycle 5개 active(id 3)&lt;br&gt;• TTS 구독자 존재 (arti/explanation_request)&lt;br&gt;• Dock 서버 준비, 배터리 ≥ 30%" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="570" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e16" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.13" target="1.15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.17" value='&lt;b&gt;REJECTED&lt;/b&gt;  _reject(text) → _emit()&lt;br&gt;/arti/course_status {"state":"REJECTED","detail":이유}' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="590" width="420" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e18" value="실패" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.15" target="1.17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.19" value='&lt;b&gt;TourMachine.start(request, now, dock_origin=현재 pose)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• resolve_selection() → plan.selected(None) = 전체 코스&lt;br&gt;• home_goal = plan.dock_approach (-0.35, -0.0957)&lt;br&gt;• state = &lt;b&gt;NAV_KIOSK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;→ Event status STARTED "1,2,3,4"&lt;br&gt;→ Event navigate(kiosk)  (언도킹 끝날 때까지 _pending_nav에 보류)' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="570" width="420" height="121" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e20" value="통과" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.8;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.15" target="1.19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.21" value="&lt;b&gt;Undock 단계&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• _undock_client.send_goal_async(Undock.Goal())&lt;br&gt;• _undock_accepted(): 수락 확인 → get_result_async&lt;br&gt;• _undock_finished(): SUCCEEDED → _await_sensors_since = now&lt;br&gt;→ _emit &lt;b&gt;UNDOCKED_WAITING_SENSORS&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="720" width="420" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e22" value="_is_docked == True" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.19" target="1.21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.23" value="&lt;b&gt;Create3 undock 액션 서버&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;스테이션에서 후진 → power_saver 해제&lt;br&gt;LiDAR 다시 회전 시작" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="720" width="420" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e24" value="Undock goal" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.21" target="1.23"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e25" value="result" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=0;exitY=0.7;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.7;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.23" target="1.21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.26" value='&lt;b&gt;_tick()  (3) 언도킹 후 센서 대기&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• fresh = pose &amp;lt; 3초 and scan &amp;lt; 3초 and TF(map→base_link) &amp;lt; 3초&lt;br&gt;• fresh 상태가 post_undock_settle_time(3초) 연속 → 다음&lt;br&gt;• 30초(post_undock_sensor_timeout) 초과 → fail()&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;이유: 바로 보내면 Nav2 "Initial robot pose is not available"&lt;/i&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="870" width="420" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e27" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.21" target="1.26"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.28" value='&lt;b&gt;_finish_post_undock(now)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• machine.set_post_undock_pose(현재 위치)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(YAML dock.approach_pose가 있으면 그 값 우선)&lt;br&gt;• _emit &lt;b&gt;UNDOCKED&lt;/b&gt; "언도킹 위치 (..); 복귀 목표 (..)"&lt;br&gt;• _dispatch(보류한 events)' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1020" width="420" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e29" value="3초 안정" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.26" target="1.28"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.30" value="&lt;b&gt;set_post_undock_pose(pose)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;home_goal = plan.dock_approach or pose" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="1020" width="420" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e31" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.28" target="1.30"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.32" value='&lt;b&gt;_dispatch(events)&lt;/b&gt; → kind별 실행&lt;br&gt;navigate → &lt;b&gt;_send_nav(name, pose)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• NavigateToPose.Goal (frame map, yaw→쿼터니언 z,w)&lt;br&gt;• _nav_generation += 1  (옛 콜백 무시용 세대 번호)&lt;br&gt;• _emit NAVIGATING "kiosk"/"1"/…/"exit"/"dock_approach"&lt;br&gt;• _nav_accepted() → _goal_handle 저장' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1170" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e33" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.28" target="1.32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.34" value="&lt;b&gt;Nav2  navigate_to_pose&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;bt_navigator → planner_server → controller_server&lt;br&gt;general_goal_checker.xy_goal_tolerance = 0.12&lt;br&gt;(cmd_vel은 Nav2만 발행, 우리 코드는 절대 안 함)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="1170" width="420" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e35" value="NavigateToPose goal" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.32" target="1.34"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.36" value="&lt;b&gt;tick(now, pose, pose_age, speed, odom_age)&lt;/b&gt;  ← _tick() (5)&lt;br&gt;state &lt;b&gt;NAV_KIOSK / NAV_ARTWORK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• _entry_inside(): _fresh_pose(2초) and _zone().contains(pose)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;_zone() = index&amp;lt;0 ? kiosk_zone : artworks[index].zone&lt;br&gt;• 반원 진입 → state &lt;b&gt;CANCELING&lt;/b&gt; → Event ZONE_ENTERED + cancel&lt;br&gt;• 180초 초과 → _recover('Nav2 이동 시간 초과')" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="1320" width="420" height="121" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e37" value="0.1초마다" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.9;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.32" target="1.36"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.38" value="&lt;b&gt;_cancel_nav()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• goal_handle 없으면 _pending_cancel = True (수락 즉시 취소)&lt;br&gt;• _goal_handle.cancel_goal_async() → _on_cancel_ack()&lt;br&gt;• 결과는 _nav_finished() 로 CANCELED 도착" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1330" width="420" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e39" value="Event cancel" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=0;exitY=0.8;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.36" target="1.38"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e40" value="cancel" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=1;exitY=0.2;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.38" target="1.34"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.41" value="&lt;b&gt;nav_result(result, now)&lt;/b&gt;  ← _nav_finished()&lt;br&gt;• STATUS_SUCCEEDED / CANCELED / ABORTED 문자열 변환&lt;br&gt;• CANCELED + CANCELING + _fresh_inside() → _begin_stop()&lt;br&gt;• SUCCEEDED인데 반원 밖 → _recover('현재 반원 도착 미확인')&lt;br&gt;• ABORTED / REJECTED → _recover()" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="1470" width="420" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e42" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.36" target="1.41"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e43" value="result (CANCELED)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=0.3;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.34" target="1.41"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.44" value="&lt;b&gt;_begin_stop()&lt;/b&gt; → state &lt;b&gt;VERIFY_STOP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;tick()&lt;/b&gt; 정지 확인:&lt;br&gt;• safe = _fresh_inside() and odom &amp;lt; 2초 and speed &amp;lt; 0.035&lt;br&gt;• still_since부터 stop_duration 0.8초 연속 유지&lt;br&gt;• 깨지면 still_since = None 리셋 / 20초 초과 → fail()" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="1620" width="420" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e45" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.41" target="1.44"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.46" value="&lt;b&gt;index &amp;lt; 0 ?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(키오스크에서 멈춘 것?)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="1770" width="300" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e47" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.44" target="1.46"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.48" value="&lt;b&gt;KIOSK_STOPPED&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• index = 0, state &lt;b&gt;NAV_ARTWORK&lt;/b&gt;, retry_count = 0&lt;br&gt;• Event guide('start')  (TTS 노드는 무시)&lt;br&gt;• Event navigate(작품 1 goal_pose)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;객체 인식(관람객 확인)은 이번 구현에서 생략&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="1770" width="400" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e49" value="YES" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.46" target="1.48"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e50" value="작품 1로 이동" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#d79b00;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.2;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.48" target="1.32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.51" value="state &lt;b&gt;EXPLAINING&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;→ Event ARTWORK_STOPPED + Event explain(explanation_id 'art_0N')&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;tick()&lt;/b&gt; 해설 중 감시:&lt;br&gt;• _fresh_inside() 아니면 fail('해설 중 반원 이탈')&lt;br&gt;• 60초(explanation_timeout) 초과 → fail()" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="1920" width="420" height="106" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e52" value="NO (작품)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.46" target="1.51"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.53" value="&lt;b&gt;_dispatch(explain)&lt;/b&gt; → _emit EXPLANATION_REQUESTED&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;_start_explanation(id)&lt;/b&gt;  (transport = topic)&lt;br&gt;• 구독자 0이면 fail('TTS 구독 노드가 없음')&lt;br&gt;• art_id = plan.artworks[index].artwork_id ('1')&lt;br&gt;• publish arti/explanation_request&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;{&quot;request_id&quot;:…, &quot;artwork_id&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1920" width="420" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e54" value="Event explain" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.51" target="1.53"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.55" value="&lt;b&gt;hardcoded_tts_node._on_request()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• json 파싱, explanation_for('1') → &quot;1번 작품을 감상하세요.&quot;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(hardcoded_explanations.EXPLANATIONS)&lt;br&gt;• _busy면 중복 거절(success false)&lt;br&gt;• Thread(_worker) 시작 (ROS 콜백 안 막히게)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;play_text(text, 'gtts')&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• gTTS(lang=ko).save(mp3) → mpg123 -q 재생 (블로킹)&lt;br&gt;🔊 PC 스피커" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="1920" width="420" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e56" value="arti/explanation_request" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.8;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.53" target="1.55"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.57" value='&lt;b&gt;_worker() → _completed 큐&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;_flush_completed()&lt;/b&gt; (0.1초 타이머)&lt;br&gt;• _busy = False → _reply()&lt;br&gt;• publish arti/explanation_result {"success":true}' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="2090" width="420" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e58" value="재생 끝난 뒤" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.55" target="1.57"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.59" value="&lt;b&gt;_on_explanation_result(msg)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• request_id 다르면 무시 (옛 응답)&lt;br&gt;• machine.explanation_result(artwork_id, success)&lt;br&gt;• _dispatch(events)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2090" width="420" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e60" value="arti/explanation_result" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.57" target="1.59"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.61" value="&lt;b&gt;explanation_result(artwork_id, success, now)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 현재 작품 ID와 다르면 fail('잘못된 작품 해설 응답')&lt;br&gt;• 반원 밖이면 fail / success false면 fail&lt;br&gt;• completed.append(id) → Event &lt;b&gt;ARTWORK_COMPLETED&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• index += 1, retry_count = 0" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="2220" width="420" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e62" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.8;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.59" target="1.61"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.63" value="&lt;b&gt;index &amp;lt; 작품 수?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(남은 작품 있음?)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="2370" width="300" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e64" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.61" target="1.63"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.65" value="state &lt;b&gt;NAV_ARTWORK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Event navigate(다음 작품 goal_pose)&lt;br&gt;작품 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 반복" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="2370" width="400" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e66" value="YES" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.63" target="1.65"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e67" value="다음 작품 (반복)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#d79b00;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.75;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.65" target="1.32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.68" value="&lt;b&gt;NAV_TO_EXIT&lt;/b&gt;  (plan.exit_goal 있을 때)&lt;br&gt;• exit_pending = True, state &lt;b&gt;NAV_EXIT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Event navigate('exit', (-0.04, 2.04))&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;tick()&lt;/b&gt;: _fresh_exit() = 출구까지 거리 ≤ 0.30m&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ &lt;b&gt;CANCELING_EXIT&lt;/b&gt; + Event EXIT_ZONE_ENTERED, cancel&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[실물] 반원 없음 / 근처에서 바로 취소 (progress checker 회피)&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="2520" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e69" value="NO (작품 4 완료)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.63" target="1.68"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e70" value="navigate exit" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=0;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.68" target="1.32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.71" value="&lt;b&gt;nav_result()&lt;/b&gt; CANCELING_EXIT&lt;br&gt;• CANCELED → SUCCEEDED로 간주, NAV_EXIT 로직 재사용&lt;br&gt;• _fresh_exit() → state &lt;b&gt;VERIFY_EXIT_STOP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;tick()&lt;/b&gt;: 출구 0.30m 안 + speed&amp;lt;0.035 0.8초&lt;br&gt;→ state &lt;b&gt;FAREWELL&lt;/b&gt;, Event EXIT_ARRIVED + guide('안녕히가세요')" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="2670" width="420" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e72" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.68" target="1.71"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.73" value='&lt;b&gt;_dispatch(guide)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;_guide_pub.publish(String("안녕히가세요"))&lt;br&gt;토픽 guide_message' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2690" width="420" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e74" value="Event guide" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=0;exitY=0.8;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.71" target="1.73"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.75" value="&lt;b&gt;_on_guide(msg)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 'start', 'tour_end'는 무시 (내부 키)&lt;br&gt;• Thread(_speak_only) → play_text()&lt;br&gt;🔊 &quot;안녕히가세요&quot;  (응답 없음, 비블로킹)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="2680" width="420" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e76" value="guide_message" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.73" target="1.75"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.77" value="state &lt;b&gt;FAREWELL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;tick()&lt;/b&gt;: farewell_duration 2초 경과&lt;br&gt;→ exit_pending = False → &lt;b&gt;_go_home()&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="2820" width="420" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e78" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.71" target="1.77"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.79" value="&lt;b&gt;_go_home(now, detail)&lt;/b&gt; → state &lt;b&gt;NAV_HOME&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Event RETURNING_HOME + navigate('dock_approach', home_goal)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;home_goal = (-0.35, -0.0957, yaw 0) 스테이션 정면 0.65m&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;tick()&lt;/b&gt;: _fresh_home() 거리 ≤ 0.30m&lt;br&gt;→ &lt;b&gt;CANCELING_HOME&lt;/b&gt; + Event HOME_ZONE_ENTERED, cancel&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[실물] &quot;Failed to make progress&quot; 방지&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="2970" width="420" height="121" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e80" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.77" target="1.79"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e81" value="navigate dock_approach" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=0;exitY=0.2;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.25;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.79" target="1.32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.82" value="&lt;b&gt;nav_result()&lt;/b&gt; CANCELING_HOME&lt;br&gt;• CANCELED/SUCCEEDED + _fresh_home() → _begin_stop(home=True)&lt;br&gt;• state &lt;b&gt;VERIFY_HOME_STOP&lt;/b&gt; → 0.8초 정지 확인&lt;br&gt;→ state &lt;b&gt;DOCKING&lt;/b&gt;, Event HOME_ARRIVED + dock" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="3120" width="420" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e83" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.79" target="1.82"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.84" value="&lt;b&gt;_start_docking()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• _emit DOCK_REQUESTED&lt;br&gt;• _dock_client.send_goal_async(Dock.Goal())&lt;br&gt;• _dock_accepted() → get_result_async&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;_dock_finished()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• success = SUCCEEDED and result.is_docked&lt;br&gt;• machine.docking_action_result(success)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="3120" width="420" height="121" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e85" value="Event dock" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.82" target="1.84"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.86" value="&lt;b&gt;Create3 dock 액션 서버&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;IR 신호로 스테이션 정밀 접근 → 충전 접점 접촉&lt;br&gt;dock_status.is_docked = true 발행" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="3120" width="420" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e87" value="Dock goal" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.84" target="1.86"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e88" value="result" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=0;exitY=0.7;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.7;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.86" target="1.84"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.89" value="&lt;b&gt;docking_action_result(success)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 실패 → fail('Dock 액션 실패')&lt;br&gt;• 성공 → state &lt;b&gt;WAIT_DOCK_CONFIRM&lt;/b&gt; (12초 내 확인 필요)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="3270" width="420" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e90" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.9;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.84" target="1.89"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.91" value="&lt;b&gt;_tick()&lt;/b&gt; (5) 마지막 부분&lt;br&gt;state == WAIT_DOCK_CONFIRM and _is_docked == True&lt;br&gt;and dock_status 3초 이내 → machine.dock_confirmed()" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="3420" width="420" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e92" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.89" target="1.91"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e93" value="dock_status" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.2;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.86" target="1.91"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.94" value="dock_confirmed()  →  state DONE&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Event DOCKED + guide('tour_end') + &lt;b&gt;COMPLETED&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;전체 작품 관람 + 원위치 복귀 + 실제 도킹 완료&quot;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#60a917;strokeColor=#2D7600;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="3420" width="420" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e95" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.91" target="1.94"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.96" value="&lt;b&gt;_recover(reason, now)&lt;/b&gt;  (복구 가능 오류)&lt;br&gt;• Nav2 ABORTED/REJECTED, 180초 초과, SUCCEEDED인데 영역 밖&lt;br&gt;• retry_count ≥ max_retries(2) → fail()&lt;br&gt;• state &lt;b&gt;WAIT_RECOVERY&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;→ Event RECOVERY_REQUIRED + cancel (로봇 정지)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="2670" width="400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.97" value='&lt;b&gt;_on_recovery(msg)&lt;/b&gt;  ← /arti/course_recovery&lt;br&gt;{"request_id":…, "action":"retry"}&lt;br&gt;• Nav2 취소 완료 전이면 거절&lt;br&gt;• _check_ready() 재검사&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;retry(now)&lt;/b&gt;: exit_pending? NAV_EXIT : index로 NAV_KIOSK/ARTWORK/HOME 결정&lt;br&gt;→ Event RECOVERY_RETRY + 같은 목표 navigate' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="2840" width="400" height="121" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e98" value="운영자 승인" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.96" target="1.97"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e99" value="재이동" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.8;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.97" target="1.32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.100" value="&lt;b&gt;fail(reason)&lt;/b&gt;  (복구 불가)&lt;br&gt;• 해설 중 반원 이탈, 해설/Dock 시간초과, 언도킹 실패…&lt;br&gt;• state &lt;b&gt;ERROR&lt;/b&gt; → Event FAILED&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;_tick()&lt;/b&gt;: ERROR면 _cancel_nav(), explain/dock goal 취소&lt;br&gt;• 언도킹 실패는 _undock_failed_latched → 노드 재시작 필요" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="3120" width="400" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.e101" value="_recover" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;exitX=1;exitY=0.7;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1.41" target="1.96"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.102" value="&lt;b&gt;_tick() 10Hz 메인 루프 순서&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(1) lifecycle 폴링: amcl, map_server, bt_navigator,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;controller_server, planner_server  get_state&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;[실물] 2초 응답 없으면 remove_pending_request 후 재요청&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(2) TF map→base_link lookup → 3초 이내면 _pose 갱신&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(3) _await_sensors_since 있으면: 언도킹 후 센서 대기만 하고 return&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(4) _undocking 이면: undock_timeout 25초 감시만 하고 return&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(5) 코스 진행 상태면: machine.tick() → _dispatch()&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;+ WAIT_DOCK_CONFIRM 확인 + ERROR 시 전부 취소" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;size=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="270" width="400" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.103" value="&lt;b&gt;구조 핵심: Event 패턴&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;TourMachine 메서드는 ROS를 직접 호출하지 않고&lt;br&gt;Event 리스트만 반환:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• status → _emit() → /arti/course_status&lt;br&gt;• navigate → _send_nav()&lt;br&gt;• cancel → _cancel_nav()&lt;br&gt;• guide → guide_message 발행&lt;br&gt;• explain → _start_explanation()&lt;br&gt;• dock → _start_docking()&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;→ ROS 없이 test_full_course.py로 단위 테스트 가능" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;size=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="590" width="400" height="211" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.104" value="&lt;b&gt;세대 번호로 옛 콜백 무시&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• _session: 코스 요청마다 +1&lt;br&gt;• _nav_generation: Nav2 goal마다 +1&lt;br&gt;• _nav_accepted/_nav_finished는 (session, generation)이&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;현재와 다르면 return&lt;br&gt;• 해설·도킹 콜백은 _session 비교&lt;br&gt;• 해설 결과는 request_id 비교" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;size=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="1020" width="400" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.105" value='&lt;b&gt;색상 범례&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="background:#dae8fc"&gt;&amp;nbsp;파랑&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; a_course_node.py 함수 (ROS 실행)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="background:#d5e8d4"&gt;&amp;nbsp;초록&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; course_engine.py TourMachine (판단)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="background:#fff2cc"&gt;&amp;nbsp;노랑&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; hardcoded_tts_node.py (음성)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="background:#f5f5f5"&gt;&amp;nbsp;회색&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; 외부 (사용자, Nav2, Create3)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="background:#ffe6cc"&gt;&amp;nbsp;주황&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; 분기&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="background:#f8cecc"&gt;&amp;nbsp;빨강&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; 거절 / 오류 / 복구&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;실선: 호출·진행 &amp;nbsp; 점선: 응답·결과&lt;br&gt;굵은 주황선: 반복 (다음 목표로 이동)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[실물] = 실물 로봇 적용을 위해 추가/수정한 부분&lt;/i&gt;' style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;size=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="2260" width="420" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1.106" value='&lt;b&gt;상태 발행 예 (/arti/course_status)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;{"request_id":"…","state":"ARTWORK_COMPLETED",&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;"detail":"1","completed":["1"],"simulation":false}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;실시간 확인:&lt;br&gt;ros2 topic echo /arti/course_status&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;주요 시간값: 정지 0.8s / 정지확인 20s / 이동 180s /&lt;br&gt;해설 60s / Dock 90s / is_docked 확인 12s /&lt;br&gt;언도킹 25s / 센서대기 30s(안정 3s) / 인사 2s' style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;size=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="3290" width="420" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="states" name="2. 상태 전이도"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2.1" value="TourMachine 상태 전이도 (course_engine.py)  —  화살표 = 전이 조건 / 호출 함수" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1400" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.2" value='&lt;b&gt;IDLE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;노드 시작 직후 대기&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1ba1e2;strokeColor=#006EAF;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="90" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.3" value='&lt;b&gt;(노드) UNDOCK + 센서 대기&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;_undock_finished → _tick(3) → _finish_post_undock&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="90" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.4" value='&lt;b&gt;NAV_KIOSK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;키오스크로 Nav2 이동&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="90" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.5" value='&lt;b&gt;NAV_ARTWORK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;작품 index로 Nav2 이동&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="90" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.6" value='&lt;b&gt;CANCELING&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;반원 진입 → Nav2 취소 결과 대기 (12s)&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="230" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.7" value='&lt;b&gt;VERIFY_STOP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;반원 안 + speed&amp;lt;0.035 0.8s&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="370" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.8" value='&lt;b&gt;EXPLAINING&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;TTS 재생 중, 결과 대기 (60s)&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="370" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.9" value='&lt;b&gt;NAV_EXIT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;출구 (-0.04, 2.04) 이동&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="370" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.10" value='&lt;b&gt;CANCELING_EXIT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;0.30m 진입 → 취소 결과 대기&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="510" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.11" value='&lt;b&gt;VERIFY_EXIT_STOP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;출구 0.30m 안 정지 0.8s&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="650" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.12" value="&lt;b&gt;FAREWELL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;'안녕히가세요' 2s 대기&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="650" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.13" value='&lt;b&gt;NAV_HOME&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;접근점 (-0.35, -0.0957) 이동&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="650" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.14" value='&lt;b&gt;CANCELING_HOME&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;0.30m 진입 → 취소 결과 대기&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="790" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.15" value='&lt;b&gt;VERIFY_HOME_STOP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;접근점 0.30m 안 정지 0.8s&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="790" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.16" value='&lt;b&gt;DOCKING&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;Dock 액션 실행 중 (90s)&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="790" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.17" value='&lt;b&gt;WAIT_DOCK_CONFIRM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;is_docked 토픽 확인 (12s)&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="790" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.18" value='&lt;b&gt;DONE  (COMPLETED)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;dock_confirmed()&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#60a917;strokeColor=#2D7600;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="930" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.19" value='&lt;b&gt;WAIT_RECOVERY&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;운영자 retry 대기 (최대 2회)&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="230" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.20" value='&lt;b&gt;ERROR  (FAILED)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10px"&gt;fail(): 진행 중 액션 모두 취소&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="510" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e21" value="start()  ← _on_request" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.2" target="2.3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e22" value="센서 3s 안정" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.3" target="2.4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e23" value="_entry_inside()" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.4" target="2.6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e24" value="_entry_inside()" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.5" target="2.6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e25" value="nav_result(CANCELED)&lt;br&gt;_begin_stop()" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.6" target="2.7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e26" value="index&amp;lt;0: KIOSK_STOPPED&lt;br&gt;(첫 작품)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#d79b00;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.7" target="2.5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e27" value="작품: ARTWORK_STOPPED" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.7" target="2.8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e28" value="explanation_result()&lt;br&gt;남은 작품 있음" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#d79b00;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.8" target="2.5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e29" value="마지막 작품 완료&lt;br&gt;NAV_TO_EXIT" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.8" target="2.9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e30" value="_fresh_exit() ≤0.30m" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.9" target="2.10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e31" value="nav_result()" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.10" target="2.11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e32" value="정지 확인&lt;br&gt;EXIT_ARRIVED" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.11" target="2.12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e33" value="2s → _go_home()" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.12" target="2.13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e34" value="_fresh_home() ≤0.30m" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.13" target="2.14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e35" value="nav_result()&lt;br&gt;_begin_stop(home)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.14" target="2.15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e36" value="HOME_ARRIVED&lt;br&gt;Event dock" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.15" target="2.16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e37" value="docking_action_result(True)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.16" target="2.17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e38" value="dock_confirmed()" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.17" target="2.18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e39" value="_recover(): ABORTED/180s/영역 밖" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.5" target="2.19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e40" value="retry() 같은 목표" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;exitX=0;exitY=0.8;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.8;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.19" target="2.5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.e41" value="횟수 초과" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2.19" target="2.20"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2.42" value="&lt;b&gt;참고&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• NAV_KIOSK, NAV_HOME, NAV_EXIT, CANCELING_HOME 도&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;실패 시 _recover() → WAIT_RECOVERY&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 모든 진행 상태는 시간 초과·반원 이탈 등&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;복구 불가 상황에서 fail() → ERROR&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• retry()의 목표 결정:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;exit_pending → NAV_EXIT&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;index&amp;lt;0 → NAV_KIOSK&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;index==N → NAV_HOME&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;그 외 → NAV_ARTWORK" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;size=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="670" width="300" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="topics" name="3. 노드·토픽 구조"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="3.1" value="노드 · 토픽 · 액션 연결 (namespace /robot4)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1400" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3.2" value="&lt;b&gt;a_course_node&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;a_course_node.py&lt;br&gt;+ course_engine.TourMachine&lt;br&gt;+ guided_tour_plan&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;파라미터: enable_motion, simulation_mode,&lt;br&gt;explanation_transport=topic,&lt;br&gt;require_dock_status, post_undock_*" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="300" width="320" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3.3" value="&lt;b&gt;hardcoded_tts_node&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;hardcoded_tts_node.py&lt;br&gt;+ hardcoded_explanations.py&lt;br&gt;engine: gtts (인터넷 + mpg123)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="330" width="280" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3.4" value="&lt;b&gt;zone_marker_node&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;zone_marker_node.py + zone_geometry.py&lt;br&gt;→ RViz 반원" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="600" width="280" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3.5" value="&lt;b&gt;RViz2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Add → By topic → MarkerArray" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;alig